  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "行行出狀元"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: bold;\">江宥呈&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（台灣大學電機系四年ê學生）</span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">俗語講「行行出狀元」，就是講無論做啥mih代誌，只要你有心，就ē-sái做kah siah-siah叫。我對tsit句話真認同，因為我相信逐項代誌只要肯努力，一定ē拚出一寡成果。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">有一个專門做talk show ê人叫做博恩，伊講伊拄tuì國外tńg來台灣ê時，台灣根本iáu無「talk show」tsit種節目，但是伊就tuì hit種專門hōo人講笑詼ê俱樂部開始練習起，bat hōo人笑--過，伊lóng無要意。沓沓仔進步到tann，伊鋪tī網路頂ê talk show影片已經有tsiânn十支lóng超過三百萬人看--過--ah，thang講是為台灣ê節目開發一種新ê模式。伊tuì一个全新ê行業做起，到tsit-má通人知，有影就是「行行出狀元」上好ê見本。</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span><b>#</b></span><b>逐家來phò-tāu&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報333期，2021年12月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjTpbA18wH-yar8-7zOygKOHAh5h7SA7fok21PVD55P4BMjMqRHVNHq1vumPPuaNLft34R786dlFI_AeZZly1I8bkCX5iNTJ0d2Frs4mT8lWKZCq722icrV5T8C-hPLqKuBJVPguxa7x7V_PnmZ_4V879LmUJ0wXmIycHoslrfipSauPYbex4xJK-JJow=s1424\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjTpbA18wH-yar8-7zOygKOHAh5h7SA7fok21PVD55P4BMjMqRHVNHq1vumPPuaNLft34R786dlFI_AeZZly1I8bkCX5iNTJ0d2Frs4mT8lWKZCq722icrV5T8C-hPLqKuBJVPguxa7x7V_PnmZ_4V879LmUJ0wXmIycHoslrfipSauPYbex4xJK-JJow=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEipTfNYzuthBH7dKD-cRsFKkDclGKRxPcfTfF0MQYdgnTYCQK_n_U-VxfNcsn6Ou7WNL3rjwD__KxGU48LeqEvwf-d-AM53fN1CI95bKiaGnjqXgYrSQlxyEIVhJ6HCDcBhts_-tXBT8jnH2CIDroVwFEEsWFuGCVeaZLCltdmUepXGWS7H7A1ffgAMLA=s3036\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEipTfNYzuthBH7dKD-cRsFKkDclGKRxPcfTfF0MQYdgnTYCQK_n_U-VxfNcsn6Ou7WNL3rjwD__KxGU48LeqEvwf-d-AM53fN1CI95bKiaGnjqXgYrSQlxyEIVhJ6HCDcBhts_-tXBT8jnH2CIDroVwFEEsWFuGCVeaZLCltdmUepXGWS7H7A1ffgAMLA=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></span></div><div><div style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">--------------------------------------------</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-family: inherit; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: inherit;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div><span><div style=\"color: #999999; font-size: large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
